# Store/cache: ignore everything except the committed config (F28, negation fixed by F38).
# Last matching pattern wins: `/*` ignores all entries, then `!index.json`
# re-includes the committed config and `!.gitignore` re-includes this rule
# file itself. Subdirectories (index/, custom/) and the store files inside
# them stay ignored — D12 constrains store.path to this dir.
/*
!index.json
!.gitignore
